BGP 인스턴스 ① (bond0)&lt;br&gt;VIP/32 광고 — 로컬 AIStor Pod 준비 시" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9B48A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2B2A27;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="972" y="110" width="376" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c30" value="Pod 종료 · drain 시&lt;br&gt;VIP 광고 철회 → 신규 연결은 다른 노드" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9B48A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2B2A27;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="972" y="168" width="376" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c31" value="노드 간 추가 경유 없음&lt;br&gt;client IP (C-IP) 보존" style="rounded=1;arcSize=6;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#C9B48A;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacing=5;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;fontSize=10;fontColor=#2B2A27;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="972" y="226" width="376" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c32" value="판단 근거&lt;br&gt;· 노드당 AIStor 1 Pod · 어느 Pod 든 처리 가능&lt;br&gt;· 외부는 Spine 방향만 진입 → 랙 균등이면 인입 균등&lt;br&gt;· eTP Cluster 는 요청 약 99% 가 bond1 로 다른 노드 경유&lt;br&gt;  (AIStor 조각 트래픽과 경합 · PUBLIC → PRIVATE)&lt;br&gt;· Maglev 는 eTP Cluster 에만 적용 → 불필요" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacing=4;fontFamily=Noto Sans KR,Malgun Gothic,Apple SD Gothic Neo,sans-serif;fontSize=11;fontColor=#2B2A27;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#8A877E;rounded=1;arcSize=4;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="960" y="350" width="400" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>